spans.s:
आ-रोपण, अम्, n. the act of placing or fixing in
or on; causing to mount or ascend, raising to heaven;
planting; trusting, delivering; the stringing of a bow.

आ-रोह, अस्, m. one who mounts or ascends, a rider
(on a horse &c.), one who is seated in a carriage;
ascent, rising, creeping up, mounting, riding; haughti-
ness, pride; elevation, elevated place, altitude; a heap,
mountain; a woman's waist, the buttocks; length;
measure; descending (= अव-रोह?); a mine.
